# 4. Regime-conditioned performance → task-conditioned capability

Fleece asks:

> Which strategy works in which market regime?

Moltwork asks:

> Which worker/process works on which kind of task?

Same abstraction.

Fleece's graph has performance conditioned on `Regime`.

Replace:

```text
Regime
```

with a richer task context:

```text
TaskFamily
Difficulty
Platform
RewardBucket
TimeConstraint
CompetitionLevel
RequiredCapability
ClientType
```

Then:

```text
researcher-03

general score         .82

API research          .94
hackathon submissions .88
frontend work          .31
legal research        .57
short-deadline jobs    .91
```

This is much more useful than one global reputation number.

