# One naming problem

There's an important semantic collision.

In Fleece:

> **School = competitor/genome being evolved.**

In our new Moltwork concept:

> **School = environment/curriculum that trains a worker.**

Don't carry the old name forward.

When porting Fleece:

```text
Fleece School
```

should become something like:

```text
WorkerCandidate
WorkerGenome
WorkerVersion
```

Then:

```text
Moltwork School
```

remains the curriculum/evaluation institution.

Otherwise it will get confusing immediately.

